{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s a peaceful day on the farm......and you are a very confused duck! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aliens took your chicken family. And so, <i>peace was never an option.</i></strong><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but his waddle, his will and a very special hat, Dodo dives into a glitched dimension to bring them back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/2ab401f9c8cbc9b0e62a453ae6c92250.poster.avif?t=1761201528\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/2ab401f9c8cbc9b0e62a453ae6c92250.webm?t=1761201528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/2ab401f9c8cbc9b0e62a453ae6c92250.mp4?t=1761201528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash, quack, waddle, float, flip and puzzle your way through cute and charming  worlds each more strange and delightful than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/1c1c20e82ae06d1e865723d0fdf0108d.poster.avif?t=1761201528\" width=720 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/1c1c20e82ae06d1e865723d0fdf0108d.webm?t=1761201528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/1c1c20e82ae06d1e865723d0fdf0108d.mp4?t=1761201528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=